## SQ-RSP-05 | 2 black tea + honey + bottle -> Strong Black Tea (kettle filled by NBT, not item replace)
bootexpect Done \(
> summon minecraft:marker 1000 -60 1000 {Tags:["rhome"]}
> data get entity @e[type=minecraft:marker,tag=rhome,limit=1] Pos
capture R entity data: \[(-?\d+)\.\d+d, (-?\d+)\.\d+d, (-?\d+)\.\d+d\]
> forceload add {R1-16} {R3-16} {R1+80} {R3+150}
> forceload add 96 496 340 560
> forceload add 400 400
> forceload add 300 60 400 60
> forceload add 96 96 127 127
sleep 5
> gamerule doDaylightCycle false
> weather clear 100000
> difficulty easy
> setblock {R1+2} {R2} {R3+106} minecraft:campfire[lit=true]
> setblock {R1+2} {R2+1} {R3+106} farmersrespite:kettle
> pbot spawn rsp5 {R1+2} {R2+1} {R3+103} minecraft:overworld survival
sleep 2
> clear rsp5
> item replace entity rsp5 weapon.mainhand with farmersrespite:black_tea 2
repeat 2
