expect RSP05 tea level 2
> data merge block {R1+2} {R2+1} {R3+106} {Inventory:{Size:5,Items:[{Slot:0,id:"minecraft:honey_bottle",Count:1b},{Slot:3,id:"minecraft:glass_bottle",Count:1b}]}}
> data get block {R1+2} {R2+1} {R3+106} Inventory
expect has the following block data: \{.*minecraft:honey_bottle
